{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23735","headline":"赠悼怀太子挽歌辞二首 二 · 白居易","name":"赠悼怀太子挽歌辞二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剪叶藩封早，承华册命尊。\n笙歌辞洛苑，风雪蔽梁园。\n卤簿凌霜宿，铭旌向月翻。\n宫寮不逮事，哭送出都门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}